@startuml Goods Movement Sequence
title Box Validation → Manifest Approval → GMR/ELO Generation

actor Loader as Loader
actor Admin
participant "Freedom API" as API
participant "Application Handler" as Handler
participant "Dapper Repository" as Repo
participant "SQL Database" as DB
participant "Customs Worker" as Worker
queue "customs-work" as GmrQueue
queue "elo-envelopes" as EloQueue
participant "Manifest Worker" as ManifestWorker
queue "manifest-documents" as DocQueue
participant "HMRC GVMS" as HMRC
participant "French ELO API" as Elo
participant "Blob Storage" as Blob

== Box Validation ==

Loader -> API: POST /boxes/{id}/validate
API -> Handler: ValidateBoxHandler
Handler -> Repo: MarkValidatedAsync({ValidatedByPersonId, ValidatedAt})
Repo -> DB: UPDATE dbo.Box SET ValidatedAt = NOW(), ValidatedByPersonId = @id WHERE Id = @id
DB --> Repo: OK
Repo --> Handler: ValidateBoxOutcome.Success
Handler --> API: 200 OK

note right of DB
  Box is now frozen:
  - Cannot add/remove items
  - Cannot change receiver
  - Cannot invalidate
end note

== Manifest Creation & Item Assignment ==

Loader -> API: POST /convoys/{convoyId}/vehicles/{vin}/manifest
API -> Handler: CreateManifestHandler
Handler -> Repo: CreateAsync({ConvoyId, Vin})
Repo -> DB: INSERT INTO dbo.Manifest ... VALUES (Proposed)
DB --> Repo: ManifestId
Repo --> Handler: CreateManifestOutcome.Created(ManifestId)
Handler --> API: 201 Created

Loader -> API: PUT /manifests/{id}/boxes/{boxId}
API -> Handler: AddManifestBoxHandler
Handler -> Repo: AddBoxAsync({ManifestId, BoxId})
Repo -> DB: INSERT INTO dbo.ManifestBox (ManifestId, BoxId) VALUES
Repo -> DB: Box must have ValidatedAt IS NOT NULL
DB --> Repo: OK
Repo --> Handler: AddManifestBoxOutcome.Success
Handler --> API: 200 OK

== Ground Officer Files ENS ==

note over Loader, Elo
  Filed outside Freedom in EU Customs Trader Portal
  (ICS2 has no API; only recorded in Freedom)
end note

Loader -> API: PUT /manifests/{id}/ens
API -> Handler: RecordEnsDeclarationHandler
Handler -> Blob: SaveAsync({ManifestId, ENS_MRN})
Blob -> Blob: CREATE BLOB ens/{manifestId}/declaration-*.json
Blob --> Handler: BlobUri
Handler --> API: 200 OK

== Manifest Approval ==

Admin -> API: POST /manifests/{id}/approve
API -> Handler: ApproveManifestHandler

Handler -> Repo: Check ENS MRN recorded
Repo -> DB: SELECT FROM dbo.EnsDeclaration WHERE ManifestId = @id
DB --> Repo: MRN

alt No ENS MRN
  Handler --> API: 409 EnsNotFiled
else ENS MRN present
  Handler -> Repo: ConfirmAndFreezeAsync
  Repo -> DB: UPDATE dbo.Manifest SET Status = Confirmed, GmrSubmittedAt = NOW()
  DB --> Repo: OK
end

== GMR Submission (Customs Worker) ==

Handler -> GmrQueue: Enqueue GMR Job
GmrQueue --> Worker: Dequeue
Worker -> HMRC: POST /submissions
HMRC --> Worker: 200 (submissionId, LRN)
Worker -> Repo: StoreGmrResponseAsync
Repo -> DB: INSERT INTO dbo.GmrDocument
DB --> Repo: OK

== ELO Envelope Creation (Customs Worker) ==

Handler -> EloQueue: Enqueue ELO Job
EloQueue --> Worker: Dequeue
Worker -> Blob: ReadAsync (ens/{manifestId})
Blob --> Worker: ENS MRN, crossing profile
Worker -> Elo: POST /enveloppe
Elo --> Worker: 200 (numeroDossier, pdf barcode)
Worker -> Blob: StoreAsync (elo/{manifestId})
Worker -> Repo: StoreEloEnvelopeAsync
Repo -> DB: INSERT INTO dbo.EloEnvelope
DB --> Repo: OK

== Manifest Document Generation (Manifest Worker) ==

Handler -> DocQueue: Enqueue Manifest Document Job
DocQueue --> ManifestWorker: Dequeue
ManifestWorker -> Repo: ReadManifestAsync
Repo -> DB: SELECT manifest, boxes, crew (no addresses)
DB --> Repo: Complete manifest data
ManifestWorker -> ManifestWorker: RenderDocument
ManifestWorker -> Blob: UploadAsync (manifests/{manifestId})
Blob --> ManifestWorker: BlobUri

== Approval Complete ==

Handler --> API: 200 OK (manifestId, gmrId, eloNumeroDossier, documentUri)

== Manifest Ready for Departure ==

note over Admin, Elo
  Manifest can now progress through remaining states:
  Proposed → Confirmed (frozen) → Ready → InTransit → Delivered
  
  Status changes no longer edit, only report what happened.
end note

Loader -> API: POST /manifests/{id}/ready
API -> Handler: TransitionManifestHandler
Handler -> Repo: UpdateStatusAsync({ManifestId, Ready})
Repo -> DB: UPDATE dbo.Manifest SET Status = Ready WHERE Id = @id AND Status = Confirmed
DB --> Repo: OK
Handler --> API: 200 OK

@enduml